 works","pushState adds an entry, replaceState replaces the current one, no reload","Back/Forward fires popstate: show the view for the new address"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":36.0,"text":"/users/42","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":156.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":194.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":280.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":36.0,"text":"UserPage(42)","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["history.pushState({}, \"\", \"/users/42\");","render();","history.replaceState({}, \"\", \"/login\");"],"hl":[0,2],"lang":"js","size":9.5,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["window.addEventListener(\"popstate\", () => {","  render(location.pathname);","});"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[13.9,27.8]}]},{"title":"Route matching","sub":"Params and nesting","short":"Matching","main":"Patterns with params, nested routes and a fallback for unknown addresses.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Patterns","Nesting","Not found"],"captions":["/users/:id: params from the path; the query is parsed separately","A chain of matched routes: layout by prefix, page by the rest","Specific patterns before general ones; last, a catch-all route *"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["match(\"/users/:id\", \"/users/42?tab=info\")","// → { params: { id: \"42\" }, query: { tab: \"info\" } }"],"hl":[1],"lang":"js","size":9.0,"lh":30.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":30.0,"w":70.0,"h":26.0,"text":"Layout","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":80.0,"w":70.0,"h":26.0,"text":"Users","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":180.0,"y":130.0,"w":70.0,"h":26.0,"text":"UserPage","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":290.0,"y":80.0,"text":"/users/42 →\nLayout › Users › UserPage","size":9.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["[ \"/\", \"/users\", \"/users/:id\", \"*\" ]","//                                    ↑ 404"],"hl":[0],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":30.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[14.2,28.4]}]},{"title":"Navigation","sub":"Links and guards","short":"Navigation","main":"Link intercepts a plain click; guards allow, block or redirect a navigation.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Link","Guards","Redirects"],"captions":["Intercept only a plain left click, no modifiers, on a same-site link","beforeEach: true to allow, false to cancel, a string to redirect","A redirect depth limit prevents loops; a new navigation cancels the old one"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":150.0,"h":36.0,"text":"click ✓ → router.push","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":150.0,"h":36.0,"text":"Ctrl-click, _blank ✗\n→ browser","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["router.beforeEach(async (to) => {","  if (to.meta.auth && !user()) return \"/login\";","  return true;","});"],"hl":[1],"lang":"js","size":9.5,"lh":24.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"/old","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":122.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":148.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":190.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":30.0,"text":"/new","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":226.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":252.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":310.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"/final","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":120.0,"text":"at most N steps","tone":"yellow","size":9.5}]],"cues":[12.8,25.6]}]},{"title":"Lazy loading","sub":"Routes on demand","short":"Lazy loading","main":"Pages load on demand via import(); a spinner shows while loading.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["import()","Spinner","Preload"],"captions":["A route is a function with a dynamic import: each page is its own file","Loading shows a spinner; an error shows a fallback; the result is cached","Start early: on link hover or when the link enters the viewport"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["{ path: \"/settings\",","  load: () => import(\"./pages/settings.js\") }"],"hl":[1],"lang":"js","size":9.5,"lh":30.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"loading…","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":122.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":148.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":210.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"ready","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":330.0,"y":70.0,"w":60.0,"h":30.0,"text":"error","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["link.addEventListener(\"mouseenter\", () => {","  route.load();   // cache: the promise is saved","});"],"hl":[1],"lang":"js","size":9.5,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[13.5,26.9]}]},{"title":"Data and errors","sub":"Route loaders","short":"Data","main":"Route data loads in parallel; an error boundary handles errors instead of crashing the app.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Parallel loaders","Error boundary","Accessibility"],"captions":["Loaders of matched routes run in parallel, not one by one","A render exception is caught by the error boundary: fallback view and Retry","On navigation, update the title and announce the page change to screen readers"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":120.0,"h":24.0,"text":"loader: layout","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":90.0,"w":120.0,"h":24.0,"text":"loader: users","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":90.0,"y":130.0,"w":120.0,"h":